{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>He began to be a mighty one on the earth.</b> Rashi wrote (Rashi on Genesis 10:8): to incite the whole world against the Holy One, blessed be He, through the counsel of the generation of the Dispersion. If so, 'he began' means after the Flood, for in the days of the generation of Enosh it had already begun. And it is possible that Scripture says a rebellion began in the generation of the Dispersion, whereas in the days of Enosh they were not in rebellion against light, but they also worshipped other elohim:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "Reading אור (light) in accordance with the reading found in Rashi's comment on Genesis 4:26, where the phrase מורדי אור appears; some witnesses may read differently."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:26:55.513553868Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}